  "prefLabel": "Plc 205.05 PANP, Voluntary Surrender Not an Admission of Wrongdoing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 205.05 PANP, Voluntary Surrender Not an Admission of Wrongdoing.\n\n(a) A PANP shall not constitute an admission of wrongdoing by the licensee.\n\n(b) The voluntary surrender of a license shall not, in and of itself, constitute an admission of wrongdoing by the licensee.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc100-200.html"
